[
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# Wikidata matches of the drowned villages\n\nInspects the output of `02-wikidata-villages`: which backbone villages got a Wikidata item, how reliable that match is, and what Wikidata knows that the backbone doesn't.\n\n**Before running:** `pnpm --filter @verdronkendorpen/exploration run fetch:backbone` and `fetch:wikidata`. Every cell queries two files:\n\n- `data/wikidata/matches.ttl`: one `vd:Village` per backbone village, with `vd:matchStatus`, the selected item as `skos:exactMatch`, and every `vd:candidate` (`vd:item`, `vd:candidateStatus`, `vd:matchedBy`, `vd:distanceKm`, `vd:classRank`).\n- `data/wikidata/villages.ttl`: the Wikidata items (labels, classes, coordinates, nlwiki article, image, Commons category, Rijksmonument number).\n\nStatuses: `matched` (one clear item), `ambiguous` (a tie), `unconfirmed` (candidates, but none selectable) and `not-found`. See the SOP for the matching rules.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Overview",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?status (COUNT(?village) AS ?villages) WHERE {\n  ?village vd:matchStatus ?status .\n}\nGROUP BY ?status\nORDER BY DESC(?villages)",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Good matches\n\nVillages with a selected item, with the item's class, distance to the backbone point and how it was found. `submerged settlement` (verdronken plaats) as class and a small distance make a reliable match.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) ?distanceKm ?matchedBy (GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT ?classLabel; separator=\", \") AS ?classes) (SAMPLE(?article) AS ?nlwiki) WHERE {\n  ?village vd:matchStatus \"matched\" ;\n    rdfs:label ?name ;\n    skos:exactMatch ?item ;\n    vd:candidate ?candidate .\n  ?candidate vd:item ?item ;\n    vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm ;\n    vd:matchedBy ?matchedBy .\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P31/rdfs:label ?classLabel }\n  OPTIONAL { ?article schema:about ?item }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?item ?distanceKm ?matchedBy\nORDER BY ?name",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "How strong the matches are: by the best class of the selected item (0 = submerged settlement, 1 = former settlement or ghost town, 2 = human settlement, 3 = other) and by kind of match.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?classRank ?matchedBy (COUNT(?village) AS ?villages) (ROUND(AVG(?distanceKm) * 100) / 100 AS ?avgDistanceKm) WHERE {\n  ?village skos:exactMatch ?item ;\n    vd:candidate ?candidate .\n  ?candidate vd:item ?item ;\n    vd:classRank ?classRank ;\n    vd:matchedBy ?matchedBy ;\n    vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm .\n}\nGROUP BY ?classRank ?matchedBy\nORDER BY ?classRank ?matchedBy",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "Matches worth a second look: the item is not a submerged or former settlement, or lies more than 2 km from the backbone point.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) ?classRank ?distanceKm WHERE {\n  ?village rdfs:label ?name ;\n    skos:exactMatch ?item ;\n    vd:candidate ?candidate .\n  ?candidate vd:item ?item ;\n    vd:classRank ?classRank ;\n    vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm .\n  FILTER(?classRank > 1 || ?distanceKm > 2)\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?item ?classRank ?distanceKm\nORDER BY DESC(?distanceKm)",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## What the matches bring\n\nHow many matched items have an nlwiki article, an image, a Commons category, a Rijksmonument number, or a date of founding or disappearance on Wikidata.\n\nSome backbone entries share one item (for example Jackenkerke and Sint Jacobskerke at the same spot), so there are fewer items than matched villages. Variables bound inside an `OPTIONAL` only see that group, so the counts bind `?item`, which occurs in each group.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?item) AS ?matched) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withArticle) AS ?nlwiki) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withImage) AS ?image) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withCommons) AS ?commonsCategory) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withMonument) AS ?rijksmonument) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?withDates) AS ?dates) WHERE {\n  ?village skos:exactMatch ?item .\n  OPTIONAL { ?article schema:about ?item . BIND(?item AS ?withArticle) }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P18 ?image . BIND(?item AS ?withImage) }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P373 ?commons . BIND(?item AS ?withCommons) }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P359 ?monument . BIND(?item AS ?withMonument) }\n  OPTIONAL { { ?item wdt:P571 ?date } UNION { ?item wdt:P576 ?date } BIND(?item AS ?withDates) }\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item ?image ?commonsCategory ?rijksmonument ?inception ?dissolved WHERE {\n  ?village rdfs:label ?name ;\n    skos:exactMatch ?item .\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P18 ?image }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P373 ?commonsCategory }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P359 ?rijksmonument }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P571 ?inception }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P576 ?dissolved }\n}\nORDER BY ?name",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Open cases\n\nAmbiguous villages: several equally strong candidates were accepted.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) ?matchedBy ?classRank ?distanceKm WHERE {\n  ?village vd:matchStatus \"ambiguous\" ;\n    rdfs:label ?name ;\n    vd:candidate ?candidate .\n  ?candidate vd:item ?item ;\n    vd:candidateStatus \"accepted\" ;\n    vd:matchedBy ?matchedBy ;\n    vd:classRank ?classRank ;\n    vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm .\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?item ?matchedBy ?classRank ?distanceKm\nORDER BY ?name ?distanceKm",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "Unconfirmed villages with their candidates: rejected on distance or class, or only found by location (`matchedBy` = `location`, a nearby drowned place that may be the same village under another name).",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) ?matchedBy ?candidateStatus ?classRank ?distanceKm WHERE {\n  ?village vd:matchStatus \"unconfirmed\" ;\n    rdfs:label ?name ;\n    vd:candidate ?candidate .\n  ?candidate vd:item ?item ;\n    vd:candidateStatus ?candidateStatus ;\n    vd:matchedBy ?matchedBy ;\n    vd:classRank ?classRank .\n  OPTIONAL { ?candidate vd:distanceKm ?distanceKm }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?item ?matchedBy ?candidateStatus ?classRank ?distanceKm\nORDER BY ?name ?distanceKm",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "Villages without any candidate.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?name ?municipality (GROUP_CONCAT(?altName; separator=\", \") AS ?altNames) WHERE {\n  ?village vd:matchStatus \"not-found\" ;\n    rdfs:label ?name .\n  OPTIONAL { ?village vd:municipality ?municipality }\n  OPTIONAL { ?village skos:altLabel ?altName }\n}\nGROUP BY ?name ?municipality\nORDER BY ?municipality ?name",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Wikidata only\n\nSubmerged settlements in the Netherlands on Wikidata that no backbone village is matched to, with the nearest backbone village that lists it as a candidate (if any). Many of these lie outside Zeeland (the query covers all of the Netherlands), so check the coordinates.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/matches.ttl]\n# [endpoint=../../data/wikidata/villages.ttl]\nPREFIX vd: <https://github.com/daanjo3/verdronkendorpen/vocab#>\nPREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>\nPREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\nPREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>\n\nSELECT ?item (SAMPLE(?itemLabel) AS ?label) (SAMPLE(?coord) AS ?coordinates) (SAMPLE(?article) AS ?nlwiki) (GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT ?nearby; separator=\", \") AS ?candidateFor) WHERE {\n  ?item wdt:P31 wd:Q20616831 .\n  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?anyVillage skos:exactMatch ?item }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item rdfs:label ?itemLabel . FILTER(LANG(?itemLabel) = \"nl\") }\n  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P625 ?coord }\n  OPTIONAL { ?article schema:about ?item }\n  OPTIONAL {\n    ?village vd:candidate ?candidate ;\n      rdfs:label ?nearby .\n    ?candidate vd:item ?item .\n  }\n}\nGROUP BY ?item\nORDER BY ?label",
    "metadata": {}
  }
]
